WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Well, I want to see your useful information first.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Then give you what you want

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,130
It all depends on your performance next time.

4
00:00:08,130 --> 00:00:09,130
Yeah I understand

5
00:00:09,130 --> 00:00:12,600
Zhang Yi, where did you die?

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,600
Give us an answer quickly

7
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,460
Are you going to teach me about the materials in your hand?

8
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,460
Go away. Come over if you can.

9
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:21,780
Okay, okay, Zhang Yi

10
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:36,110
Just let them come as many people as you want.

11
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:42,220
Everyone, our primary goal now is to deal with Zhang Yi

12
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:46,220
They probably have more supplies than all of us combined.

13
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:48,350
Just knock it down

14
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:50,350
We can get a lot of supplies

15
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:53,150
So you don't have to worry

16
00:00:53,150 --> 00:00:56,150
I won't attack anyone else now
